{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creator\u2019s Fall</strong> is an action roguelike with various classes, where you can choose between different paths. The goal is to reach and defeat the final boss at the end of the path. Levels are dynamically generated and feature different biomes. You can choose an upgrade after each level up. With every new level, the number of enemies increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/b29e35427d370767d5d8d6a0459426f1.poster.avif?t=1762368239\" width=940 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/b29e35427d370767d5d8d6a0459426f1.webm?t=1762368239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/b29e35427d370767d5d8d6a0459426f1.mp4?t=1762368239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 factions, each with 4 classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode for own class creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path-based progression with dynamic level generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades for your character</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/61b6c453989a4301fb79855e115a68d4.poster.avif?t=1762368239\" width=940 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co